# Second boot: what the first one wrote is here, synced or not.
! panicked
! storage failed
< \r\n~> 
> cd /\r
< \r\n/> 
> cat notes.txt\r
< first line\r\nsecond line
< \r\n/> 
> cat work/inner.txt\r
< kept
< \r\n/> 
> cat work/new.txt\r
< moved
< \r\n/> 
> cat unsynced.txt\r
< the shell never asked
< \r\n/> 
> cat gone.txt\r
< cat: gone.txt: not found
< \r\n/> 
> poweroff\r
